--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -9,6 +9,18 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Navigation readiness
+
+Page navigation uses native cross-document view transitions. Keep critical CSS in
+the shared layout's `<head>` and mark any future layout-critical head scripts with
+`blocking="render"` so they execute before the destination snapshot. The initial
+layout is currently server-rendered and does not depend on client JavaScript.
+Each page must include exactly one `id="initial-view"` checkpoint after its initial
+content, before long article bodies or secondary sections. The shared
+`rel="expect"` link waits for that HTML to be parsed; it does not wait for images
+or React hydration. Analytics, ads, and interaction-only hydration remain
+non-blocking. Reduced-motion users and unsupported browsers use normal navigation.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
